entry.content:
get_certified_letter_status: outputSchema
prepare_certified_letter: description, inputSchema, outputSchema  +or $50.10 as a Deadline Notice (service CERTIFIED_DEADLINE): the Evidence Pack plus a second copy of the same letter sent the same day by plain First-Class Mail, which is not returned when the certified copy is refused or left unclaimed, and an email to the sender if USPS reports the certified copy unclaimed, refused or undelivered;
quote_certified_letter: description, inputSchema, outputSchema  -or -Pack. +Pack, or $50.10 as a Deadline Notice.
